    "title": "Video: Firefighters use the Jaws of Life at Harwich crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 hours ago HARWICH – Firefighters had to use the Jaws of Life to free at least one victim from a crash in Harwich about 8:10 AM Wednesday. It happened on Sisson Road (Route 39) at Gilbert Ln. That person was taken to Cape Cod Hospital with serious injuries. Harwich Police are investigating the cause of the crash. Further details were not immediately available. Read full article\n3",
